    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d220">

                <pb facs="0209" n="203" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg203"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Sir
                            Julian Pauncefote.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-02"><hi rendition="#italic">June 2,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith
                    copy of a bill which has passed both Houses of Congress and been approved by the
                    President, entitled “A bill supplementary to an act approved April 6, 1894, for
                    the execution of the award rendered at Paris, August 15, 1893, by the Tribunal
                    of Arbitration constituted under the treaty between the United States and Great
                    Britain, concluded at Washington, February 29, 1892, in relation to the
                    preservation of the fur seal.”</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d220-a1.xml" xpointer="d220-a1"/>
            </div>
